{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/691986a1d44dbab9e6a717c21a747e6f.poster.avif?t=1757793514\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/691986a1d44dbab9e6a717c21a747e6f.webm?t=1757793514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/691986a1d44dbab9e6a717c21a747e6f.mp4?t=1757793514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/fb196fde2904a1aaacab3054a965490c.webp?t=1757793514\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Community Leader to World Leader</strong><br>Every day throws you an event that could make\u2014or break\u2014your run. Grow your crew, collect shiny buttons, and blast propaganda to secure votes at the polls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win Hearts or Break Rivals</strong><br>Charm blocs with outreach, or sabotage your opponent until they throw in the towel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/4f228b2038b38210f97b4caee457ebe0.poster.avif?t=1757793514\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/4f228b2038b38210f97b4caee457ebe0.webm?t=1757793514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/4f228b2038b38210f97b4caee457ebe0.mp4?t=1757793514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Debates, Reimagined</strong><br>Rock\u2013paper\u2013scissors your way to victory. Politics has never been sillier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/85342a747aeb03f8334fcf73f61ed5c8.webp?t=1757793514\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money Talks</strong><br>Budget responsibly\u2026 or just pocket it all. Who\u2019s going to stop you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/08f22ed1740a796e3180d9454b20b2f3.poster.avif?t=1757793514\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/08f22ed1740a796e3180d9454b20b2f3.webm?t=1757793514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/08f22ed1740a796e3180d9454b20b2f3.mp4?t=1757793514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press Roulette</strong><br>Hate interviews? Spin the wheel and let fate choose your platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend the Calendar</strong><br>Don\u2019t like tomorrow\u2019s agenda? Reschedule it\u2014or cancel it. You\u2019re the boss here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/d164cf6a04ec094b1046439669739533.poster.avif?t=1757793514\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://s